{"sha": "66015e05985de04e976c8b427fd366a2ee712c2c9cc1271ad08f9e8d39604e28", "body": ["\\textbf{2.} $j_d = \\varepsilon_0\\partial_tE = I(t)/\\pi R^2 = 32\\cos\\omega t$ A/m$^2$；其", "穿过极板的通量为 $I(t)$。", "", "\\textbf{3.} $2\\pi rB = \\mu_0\\varepsilon_0\\pi r^2\\partial_tE$：$B = \\mu_0I(t)r/2\\pi R^2$；在 $R$ 处：", "$\\mu_0I_0/2\\pi R = \\qty{2}{\\micro T}$。", "", "\\textbf{4.} 对 $r > R$，全部位移电流都被包围在内：$B =", "\\mu_0I/2\\pi r$，即导线的磁场；在 $R$ 处连续。", "", "\\textbf{5.} $(\\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}\\vect E_1)_\\theta = -\\partial_rE_1 = -\\partial_tB_\\theta$，于是 $\\partial_rE_1", "= \\mu_0\\varepsilon_0(r/2)\\ddot E$，且 $E_1(r) - E_1(0) = \\mu_0\\varepsilon_0r^2\\ddot E/4$；代入", "$\\ddot E = -\\omega^2E$：$|E_1(R) - E_1(0)|/|E| = (\\omega R/c)^2/4 = 1 \\times 10^{-6}$。", "", "\\textbf{6.} 很好。$10\\%$ 时需 $(\\omega R/c)^2 = 0.4$，$f \\approx \\qty{300}{MHz}$ ---", "此时为谐振腔，不再是电容器。", "", "\\textbf{7.} $W_e = \\tfrac12\\varepsilon_0E_0^2\\pi R^2d = \\qty{4.5e-5}{J}$；$W_m = \\int_0^R(\\mu_0I_0r/", "2\\pi R^2)^2/2\\mu_0\\cdot2\\pi rd\\,\\dd r = \\mu_0I_0^2d/16\\pi = \\qty{2.5e-11}{J}$；比值 $6 \\times", "10^{-7} \\approx (\\omega R/c)^2/8$：二者为同一小参数。", "", "\\textbf{8.} $\\oint\\vect E\\cdot\\dd\\vect l = 2\\pi r_0E_\\theta = -\\dd\\Phi/\\dd t$。", "", "\\textbf{9.} $\\dd p/\\dd t = e|E_\\theta| = (e/2\\pi r_0)|\\dd\\Phi/\\dd t|$；每转一圈", "有 $2\\pi r_0\\cdot e|E_\\theta| = e|\\dd\\Phi/\\dd t|$。", "", "\\textbf{10.} 由 $p = eB(r_0)r_0$ 得 $\\dot p = er_0\\dot B(r_0)$；与第 9 题联立：", "$B(r_0) = \\Phi/2\\pi r_0^2 = \\tfrac12\\langle B\\rangle$。", "", "\\textbf{11.} 均匀磁场使 $B(r_0) = \\langle B\\rangle$，为所需值的两倍：", "磁力增长快于动量，轨道", "收缩。磁极的形状使磁场在靠近", "轴线处强，在轨道上则只有一半。", "", "\\textbf{12.} $p = eBr_0 = \\qty{3.2e-20}{kg.m/s}$；$E = pc = \\qty{9.6e-12}{J} = \\qty{60}{MeV}$；", "$\\Phi = 2\\pi r_0^2B = \\qty{0.63}{Wb}$ 在 \\qty{5}{ms} 内：每圈 \\qty{126}{eV}，$4.8 \\times", "10^5$ 圈，\\qty{1500}{km} --- 以 $c$ 计，\\qty{5}{ms} 内所走距离相同：一致。", "", "\\textbf{13.} 能量来自磁铁的电源，经", "法拉第项交给电子：变化的磁通量产生加速电场。", "", "\\textbf{14.} 数十 MeV 的电子在重靶中制动，产生", "穿透力强的 X 射线；紧凑型直线加速器，剂量", "率更高，取代了它。", "", "\\textbf{15.} $\\operatorname{div}\\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}\\vect A = 0$；$\\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}(-\\operatorname{\\vect{grad}}", "V - \\partial_t\\vect A) = -\\partial_t\\operatorname{\\vect{curl}}\\vect A = -\\partial_t\\vect B$。", "", "\\textbf{16.} $\\frac1{r^2}(r^2V')' = -\\rho_0/\\varepsilon_0$：$V = \\rho_0(3a^2 - r^2)/6\\varepsilon_0$", "内部，外部为 $\\rho_0a^3/3\\varepsilon_0r = Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r$；$E = \\rho_0r/3\\varepsilon_0$ 与", "$Q/4\\pi\\varepsilon_0r^2$。", "", "\\textbf{17.} $\\tfrac12\\int\\rho V\\,\\dd\\tau = 2\\pi\\rho_0^2(a^5/6 - a^5/30)/\\varepsilon_0 = 4\\pi\\rho_0^2a^5/", "15\\varepsilon_0 = 3Q^2/20\\pi\\varepsilon_0a$；铀：\\qty{1.6e-10}{J} $\\approx \\qty{1000}{MeV}$（裂变", "释放的 \\qty{200}{MeV}，即两个较小的球所省的能量）。", "", "\\textbf{18.} $V = -E(t)z$（另加一常数）。设 $\\vect A = A_z(r, t)\\vect e_z$，", "由 $B_\\theta = -\\partial_rA_z = \\mu_0Ir/2\\pi R^2$ 得 $A_z = -\\mu_0I(t)r^2/4\\pi R^2$。", "", "\\textbf{19.} $-\\partial_tA_z = \\mu_0\\dot Ir^2/4\\pi R^2 = \\mu_0\\varepsilon_0r^2\\ddot E/4$（因 $\\dot I =", "\\varepsilon_0\\pi R^2\\ddot E$）：即第 5 题中的修正，差一个常数。", "", "\\textbf{20.} $\\operatorname{div}\\vect A = \\partial_zA_z = 0$，因 $A_z$", "仅依赖于 $r$；任意 $\\vect A + \\operatorname{\\vect{grad}}\\chi$ 亦然。", "", "\\textbf{21.} $\\sigma = \\varepsilon_0E_0 = \\qty{5}{\\micro C/m^2}$；金属内部 $\\vect E =", "\\vect 0$，故跃变 $\\sigma/\\varepsilon_0$ 恰为间隙场。", "", "\\textbf{22.} 电流 $I(t)$ 从轴心向极板供给；超过 $r$ 的、", "仍待输送的部分为 $I(1 - r^2/R^2)$，故 $j_s = I(1 -", "r^2/R^2)/2\\pi r$。在外表面，由安培环路定理得导线的磁场 $\\mu_0I/", "2\\pi r$；在内表面为 $\\mu_0Ir/2\\pi R^2$；二者之差 $\\mu_0I(1 -", "r^2/R^2)/2\\pi r = \\mu_0j_s$，即边界跃变。", "", "\\textbf{23.} 极板：$R/\\lambda = 3 \\times 10^{-4}$，电似稳。回路：$7 \\times 10^{-4}$，", "磁似稳。在 \\qty{1}{GHz} 时：$R/\\lambda = 0.3$ --- 既是谐振腔，也是天线。", "", "\\textbf{24.} 对于米级的环，$\\lambda = \\qty{3000}{km}$：位移", "电流完全可以忽略；起主要作用的电场", "是法拉第感应电场，磁似稳完整地保留了它。", "", "\\textbf{25.} I：安培–麦克斯韦（位移电流）、法拉第（修正项）、", "能量密度。II：法拉第积分、洛伦兹力。", "III：势、泊松（高斯）。IV：$\\vect E$", "和 $\\vect B$ 的边界跃变；由尺寸与波长之比判定所属区域。", "\\end{solution}", ""]}